+     * fade, a trigger effect -- refresh the window on every packet, so the
+     * thread never wrote and the ride never stamped: rumble frozen at its last
+     * pair for the length of the run, a stop included. A per-frame flagged
+     * writer now gets the thread's packets exactly as before mgvf-0020, which
+     * costs what it cost and no more. */
+    if (!dualsense_bt_output_is_inert(report, DUALSENSE_BT_REPORT_LEN)) return FALSE;
